abstract: >-
  Per-domain results of an independent anti-bot / WAF scan of the top 1,000,000 sites,
  seeded from the Tranco research ranking (run top1m-20260614): 998,497 sites probed,
  818,614 reachable, and 53.5% of reachable sites run a managed anti-bot or WAF.
